# What each land's growth has done to the things people built in it
# (BiomeDef.overgrowth): beside the nearest house to the moss, the crags and the
# drowned city at noon, and the green towers for the whole dose. (The pinewood's
# nearest house is out of `near`'s reach on seed 7.)
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_growth.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place moss
near house
wait 3.0
shot moss-house with prop:house
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end moss-house
place the_crags
near house
wait 3.0
shot crags-house with prop:house
place drowned_city
near house
wait 3.0
shot drowned-house with prop:house
place typical_green_towers
wait 3.0
shot towers with land:green_towers
